Source common.tape
Output workflow.mp4
Env SCENE_FILE "prime/Prime.lean:3"
Source open.tape

Type "8gg" Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Type "11gg" Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Ctrl+B Right Sleep 500ms
Type "[" Sleep 2s
Type "[" Sleep 2s
Type "]" Type "]" Sleep 1s
Type "?" Sleep 3s
Escape Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+B Left Sleep 500ms
Type "26gg" Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 4s
